# Kandelo patch rationale (S34)
#
# Node may reuse a compiled cache with a different filename or source
# origin. Keep the source-map pragma and metadata reset/access operations
# needed to update real compiler data without reparsing. The complete
# coordinate-mapping algorithm now lives in bridge code and openly depends
# on pinned private frontend interfaces. Changing stack strings alone, or
# rejecting all reusable caches, would change Node behavior.
#
# Source-only cleanup; not rebuilt or behavior-qualified. Retention remains
# subject to README.md: Future work: platform omissions.

